<title>EU: Bonino holds news conference.</title>
<headline>Bonino holds news conference.</headline>
<text>
<p>Please note the following addition to the Reuters EU diary for Tuesday, August 12:</p>
<p>BRUSSELS (EXPANDED ITEM) - European Commissioner Emma Bonino holds news conference on her trip to Iraq at 1210/1010 GMT.</p>
</text>
